# ── mela-letterhead intermediates and output ──────────────────
# Rewritten on every build; `build --keep-build` is what leaves them behind.
.letterhead-build/
# A build writes its PDF beside the source, so running the scaffold anywhere in
# the tree drops one here. Nothing this project ships is a PDF.
*.pdf
# What `mela-letterhead init .` writes if it is ever run at the repo root.
/letterhead.yaml
/example-letter.md
/assets/logo.*

